/E (The six categories were: AI-Driven Methodologies, Employee Well-being, Ethical Considerations, Sustainability, and Future HRM. Categorization is thematic by nature. For this analysis, the Braun and Clarke \(2006\) approach to six-phase qualitative data analysis was applied.)
